### LUMIERE CINEMA - BOOKING API TEST EXAMPLES
### Sử dụng trong VSCode với REST Client extension hoặc Postman

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api
@contentType = application/json

### 1. GET Available Concessions (No auth required)
GET {{baseUrl}}/concessions
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### 2. GET Concessions Menu
GET {{baseUrl}}/concessions/menu
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### 3. GET Available Schedules
GET {{baseUrl}}/schedules?size=5
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### 4. GET Seat Status for Schedule (Replace {scheduleId} with actual ID)
GET {{baseUrl}}/bookings/schedules/1/seats
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### 5. Create Guest Booking with Concessions (MAIN TEST)
POST {{baseUrl}}/bookings/guest
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "scheduleId": 1,
  "seatIds": [1, 2],
  "sessionId": "SESSION-TEST-20241212-143015",
  "customerName": "Nguyễn Văn A",
  "customerEmail": "customer@example.com",
  "customerPhone": "0901234567",
  "paymentMethod": "ONLINE",
  "notes": "Test booking với đồ ăn/uống",
  "concessionOrders": [
    {
      "concessionId": 1,
      "quantity": 2,
      "unitPrice": 45000,
      "notes": "Extra butter"
    },
    {
      "concessionId": 3,
      "quantity": 2,
      "unitPrice": 35000,
      "notes": "No ice"
    }
  ],
  "isGuestBooking": true,
  "needsWheelchairAccess": false,
  "hasChildren": true
}

### 6. Create Simple Guest Booking (Seats Only)
POST {{baseUrl}}/bookings/guest
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "scheduleId": 1,
  "seatIds": [3, 4],
  "sessionId": "SESSION-SIMPLE-20241212-143020",
  "customerName": "Trần Thị B",
  "customerEmail": "customer2@example.com",
  "customerPhone": "0912345678",
  "paymentMethod": "CASH",
  "notes": "Chỉ đặt ghế, không có đồ ăn",
  "isGuestBooking": true
}

### 7. Family Booking Scenario
POST {{baseUrl}}/bookings/guest
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "scheduleId": 1,
  "seatIds": [20, 21, 22, 23],
  "sessionId": "FAMILY-SESSION-20241212-150000",
  "customerName": "Gia đình Nguyễn",
  "customerEmail": "family.nguyen@example.com",
  "customerPhone": "0903456789",
  "paymentMethod": "ONLINE",
  "notes": "Gia đình 4 người - 2 người lớn, 2 trẻ em",
  "concessionOrders": [
    {
      "concessionId": 1,
      "quantity": 2,
      "unitPrice": 45000,
      "notes": "2 bắp rang size lớn cho cả gia đình"
    },
    {
      "concessionId": 3,
      "quantity": 4,
      "unitPrice": 25000,
      "notes": "4 nước ngọt cho mọi người"
    }
  ],
  "isGuestBooking": true,
  "hasChildren": true,
  "needsWheelchairAccess": false
}

### 8. Get Booking Details (Replace {bookingId} with actual ID from previous requests)
GET {{baseUrl}}/bookings/1
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### 9. Get Booking Concessions
GET {{baseUrl}}/bookings/1/concessions
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### 10. Get Booking Summary (Complete info with seats + concessions)
GET {{baseUrl}}/bookings/1/summary
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### 11. Add Concession to Existing Booking (Requires Admin Token)
# First get admin token:
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### Use the token from above login response
@adminToken = YOUR_ADMIN_TOKEN_HERE

### Then add concession
POST {{baseUrl}}/bookings/1/concessions
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "concessionId": 2,
  "quantity": 1,
  "unitPrice": 25000,
  "notes": "Thêm sau khi đã booking"
}

### 12. Update Concession Quantity
PUT {{baseUrl}}/bookings/1/concessions/1?quantity=3
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 13. Remove Concession from Booking
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/bookings/1/concessions/2
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 14. Check Concession Availability
GET {{baseUrl}}/concessions/1/availability?quantity=5
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### 15. Get In-Stock Concessions Only
GET {{baseUrl}}/concessions/in-stock
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### VALIDATION TESTS

### 16. Test Invalid Phone Number (Should fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/bookings/guest
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "scheduleId": 1,
  "seatIds": [1, 2],
  "sessionId": "SESSION-INVALID-PHONE",
  "customerName": "Test Invalid Phone",
  "customerEmail": "test@example.com",
  "customerPhone": "123456",
  "isGuestBooking": true
}

### 17. Test Missing Guest Information (Should fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/bookings/guest
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "scheduleId": 1,
  "seatIds": [1, 2],
  "sessionId": "SESSION-MISSING-INFO",
  "isGuestBooking": true
}

### QUICK START GUIDE:
### 1. Start the application: ./run-app.ps1
### 2. Wait for startup (check http://localhost:8080/api/concessions)
### 3. Run test #3 to get available schedules
### 4. Update scheduleId in tests with real schedule ID
### 5. Run test #4 to see available seats for that schedule
### 6. Update seatIds in tests with available seat IDs
### 7. Run test #5 (main test) to create booking with concessions
### 8. Use returned bookingId in subsequent tests
### 9. Check Swagger UI at: http://localhost:8080/swagger-ui/index.html

### IMPORTANT NOTES:
### - Thay thế scheduleId, seatIds, bookingId bằng giá trị thực từ API
### - Kiểm tra concessionId có sẵn qua endpoint /concessions
### - sessionId phải unique cho mỗi booking
### - Guest booking cần đầy đủ thông tin customer
### - Admin token cần thiết cho một số operations 